Development tools
-----------------

The golden-test harness in tests/js-harness uses the original TypeScript
sources of git-diff-view and fast-diff@1.3.0 to generate reference data.
These JavaScript/TypeScript sources and the development tools are not
distributed with the compiled libraries or NuGet packages. The ported C#
code and embedded grammar/theme resources are covered by the notices above.

